NOTE ON CONTENT / 문서 내용에 대한 고지

This license covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only.

The documentation content under `site_src/docs/` is derived from posts written
by users of the arca.live AI art channel. Copyright in those posts remains with
their respective authors. This project quotes them briefly and links back to
every source post. It is published as commentary and reference, not as a
substitute for the originals. Authors who want their material removed may open
an issue.

`site_src/docs/` 의 문서 내용은 아카라이브 이용자들이 쓴 글에서 나온 것이고,
저작권은 각 작성자에게 있다. 이 라이선스는 코드에만 적용된다.
